.TH QUIPU-EPISODE 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-episode \- Ingest a structured episode of nodes and edges from JSON
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu episode\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-base\-ns\fR] [\fB\-\-timestamp\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIfile.json\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Ingest a structured episode of nodes and edges from JSON
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-base\-ns\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Base namespace for episode entities
.TP
\fB\-\-timestamp\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Valid\-time timestamp for the operation
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIfile.json\fR>

